Rage JEPA — Marc / Rage Industries, 2026

The code, released model weights, authored simulation recordings and
documentation in this repository are provided under the MIT license.

This is an independent state-vector implementation inspired by I-JEPA,
action-conditioned V-JEPA 2 and VICReg. No upstream pretrained weights,
image/video datasets or implementation code are redistributed.

References:
I-JEPA: https://arxiv.org/abs/2301.08243
V-JEPA 2: https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.09985
VICReg: https://arxiv.org/abs/2105.04906

PyTorch, NumPy, MuJoCo and CasADi are separately installed dependencies.
Their licenses remain their own. No third-party robot CAD, meshes or actuator
tables are included.
